  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance for the OfD programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPD technical assistance. Technical assistance in relation to the planning of petroleum resource activities for the OfD programme. Through the OfD program, Norwegian institutions share experiences and build competence in partner country authorities, who are responsible for managing the petroleum sector in their respective countries. This includes efficient mechanisms for reducing climate gas emissions from petroleum production, i.e. flaring and methane emissions. Competence transfer in this area includes effective rules and regulations on emissions to air, CO2 pricing and taxes, technical solutions to prevent fugitive emissions, infrastructure requirements for handling associated gas, measuring emissions, reporting requirements, data collection and monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
